pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: $paper
notes: |
  40 秒。这一页是全场技术含量最高的一页：子任务数量按公式算出来，不靠人估。
  把日=30、周=4、月=1 这组映射念清楚，这是 PDF 明确要求的硬约束。
elements:
  - elementId: p03-top
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
    border: {color: $accent, width: 0}
  - elementId: p03-code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 32, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $section
      text: 02 / 硬约束代码化
  - elementId: p03-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 54, 864, 38]
    content:
      text: 子任务数量由公式计算，不由人估
      style: $pageTitle
  - elementId: p03-tbl-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 106, 520, 16]
    content:
      text: 五类工单的子任务计算规则（硬约束）
      style: $label
      fontSize: 8.5
      letterSpacing: 1
  - elementId: p03-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [48, 128, 520, 188]
    style: $spec
    columnWidths:
      - 0.2
      - 0.52
      - 0.28
    rowHeights:
      - 0.2
      - 0.16
      - 0.16
      - 0.16
      - 0.16
      - 0.16
    rows:
      - - text: 工单类型
        - text: 子任务数量公式
        - text: 说明
      - - text: 巡视
        - text: 站点数量 × 巡检周期 × 巡检频率
        - text: 三类合一
      - - text: 设备检查
        - text: 站点数量 × 巡检周期 × 巡检频率
        - text: 同上
      - - text: 其他
        - text: 站点数量 × 巡检周期 × 巡检频率
        - text: 同上
      - - text: 特巡
        - text: 站点数量 × 巡检次数
        - text: 按次数
      - - text: 消缺
        - text: 固定 1 个
        - text: 单点处置
  - elementId: p03-freq-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 332, 520, 16]
    content:
      text: 巡检周期的频率映射
      style: $label
      fontSize: 8.5
      letterSpacing: 1
  - elementId: p03-f1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 354, 164, 62]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $surface}
    border: {color: $ink, width: 1.2}
  - elementId: p03-f1-n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 362, 136, 30]
    content:
      text: '30'
      style: $metric
      fontSize: 24
  - elementId: p03-f1-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 392, 136, 18]
    content:
      text: 日巡检 / 每周期
      style: $small
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
  - elementId: p03-f2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [224, 354, 164, 62]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $surface}
    border: {color: $ink, width: 1.2}
  - elementId: p03-f2-n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [238, 362, 136, 30]
    content:
      text: '4'
      style: $metric
      fontSize: 24
  - elementId: p03-f2-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [238, 392, 136, 18]
    content:
      text: 周巡检 / 每周期
      style: $small
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
  - elementId: p03-f3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [400, 354, 168, 62]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $surface}
    border: {color: $ink, width: 1.2}
  - elementId: p03-f3-n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [414, 362, 140, 30]
    content:
      text: '1'
      style: $metric
      fontSize: 24
  - elementId: p03-f3-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [414, 392, 140, 18]
    content:
      text: 月巡检 / 每周期
      style: $small
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
  - elementId: p03-right
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [596, 106, 316, 310]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $surface}
    border: {color: $ink, width: 1.5}
  - elementId: p03-right-head
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [596, 106, 316, 26]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $ink}
    border: {color: $ink, width: 0}
  - elementId: p03-right-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [610, 110, 290, 18]
    content:
      text: 为什么必须写进代码
      style: $label
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: $accentPale
      letterSpacing: 1
      align: [left, middle]
  - elementId: p03-right-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [612, 146, 286, 62]
    content:
      text: |-
        子任务数直接决定派工量、
        工时估算和考核口径。
        算错一个，整月的报表
        全部失真。
      style: $small
      fontSize: 9
      lineHeight: 1.55
  - elementId: p03-right-div
    elementType: line
    bounds: [612, 218, 286, 1]
    viewBox: [286, 1]
    points: 0,0 286,0
    border: {width: 0.7, color: $rule}
  - elementId: p03-right-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [612, 232, 286, 62]
    content:
      text: |-
        公式放在 services/work_order.py
        的 calc_subtask_count()，
        求解器与接口共用同一份实现，
        不重复写第二遍。
      style: $small
      fontSize: 9
      lineHeight: 1.55
  - elementId: p03-right-div2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [612, 304, 286, 1]
    viewBox: [286, 1]
    points: 0,0 286,0
    border: {width: 0.7, color: $rule}
  - elementId: p03-right-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [612, 318, 286, 82]
    content:
      text: |-
        求解器在生成方案前会复核：
        巡视类必须给出巡检周期与
        频率；特巡次数至少为 1；
        消缺只能对应单个站点。
        不满足直接判为不可行。
      style: $small
      fontSize: 9
      lineHeight: 1.55
  - elementId: p03-band
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 436, 864, 48]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
    border: {color: $accent, width: 0}
  - elementId: p03-band-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 442, 828, 36]
    content:
      text: 硬约束的判断标准：算错了会导致方案不可行，或者会让报表口径失真。
      style: $body
      fontSize: 13
      color: $white
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
  - elementId: p03-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 494, 800, 26]
    content:
      text: |-
        依据：backend/app/core/enums.py 第 21-26 行定义五类工单；第 158-160 行注释给出三条公式；
        backend/app/ai/nodes.py 第 350-356 行与 backend/app/services/work_order.py 的 FREQUENCY_PER_CYCLE 给出频率映射。
      style: $small
      fontSize: 7.5
      lineHeight: 1.5
  - elementId: p03-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [872, 494, 40, 16]
    content:
      text: '03'
      style: $small
      fontSize: 9
      color: $ink
      bold: true
      align: [right, middle]
